<title>NETHERLANDS: DUTCH SUGAR BEET FORECAST TO BE ISSUED AUG 12.</title>
<headline>DUTCH SUGAR BEET FORECAST TO BE ISSUED AUG 12.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Dutch Institute for Sugar Research (IRS) said on Monday the second estimate for this year's beet crop will be issued on Tuesday, August 12.</p>
<p>On July 29, IRS said in its first forecast for 1997 that the yield was 9.4 tonnes per hectare white value and the beet weight 58.6 tonnes.</p>
<p>IRS switched last year to issuing computer-generated crop forecasts for sugar beet, replacing traditional estimates based on crop reports from the field.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam Newsroom +31 20 504 5000</p>
